\item{\strong{Percentage/Coverage ("percent"):}}{
Transformation: Arcsine-square root only

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode">}}\preformatted{\\strong\{Rationale:\} Data bounded between 0-1 (proportions) or 0-100 (percentages)
